{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116633","id":3313586029,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7FgU9t","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116633","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116633.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116633.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116633","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116633/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116633/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116633/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0c8c425f9be73b3ff43b96e9998edb3608b743a0","number":116633,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"iOS: Propagate VC UI preferences to SwiftUI hosting controller","user":{"login":"jaypaik","id":8624213,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjQyMTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8624213?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaypaik","html_url":"https://github.com/jaypaik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaypaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaypaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaypaik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaypaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaypaik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaypaik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaypaik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaypaik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaypaik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #116632\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115552\r\n\r\nThe SwiftUI lifecycle migration (#109974) wraps `GDTViewController` inside a `UIViewControllerRepresentable`. The hosting controller becomes the window's root view controller, but it doesn't delegate `preferredScreenEdgesDeferringSystemGestures`, `prefersHomeIndicatorAutoHidden`, or `prefersStatusBarHidden` to child VCs. Since iOS queries the root VC for these, the corresponding Godot project settings (`suppress_ui_gesture`, `hide_home_indicator`, `hide_status_bar`) are silently ignored.\r\n\r\nThis adds `propagateUIPreferencesToRootViewController` which copies `GDTViewController`'s existing method implementations onto the hosting controller's class using `class_addMethod` / `method_setImplementation`, called from `viewDidAppear:` when the window hierarchy is established.\r\n\r\nGuarded with `#ifdef IOS_ENABLED` since visionOS doesn't use these APIs.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.git